Scope of this license (public framework / private content)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Apache-2.0 license covers the neuroscribe FRAMEWORK ONLY: the skills,
agents, scripts, schemas, the local MCP server, hooks, and documentation
in this repository, plus the synthetic example profiles (*.example.yaml)
and the synthetic 'example' journal fixture. No real journal's profile
ships in-tree; real venues are supplied by the user at runtime.

The license does NOT extend to, and this repository must never contain:
  - copyrighted exemplar manuscripts / PDFs (they live only in a user's
    private, uncommitted `.neuroscribe/journal/<slug>/exemplars/`);
  - any user's project profile or unpublished manuscript content
    (private `.neuroscribe/project/<name>/`);
  - any real journal's profile (real venues are user-supplied at runtime).
The `scripts/lint_no_journal_content.py` guard and `.gitignore` enforce
this boundary.

